	"description": "Create new skills and improve skill behavior across Claude and Copilot. Use when users want to create a skill from scratch, port an external skill into this repository, evaluate skill behavior, or refine a skill description for better triggering.",
	"license": "Complete terms in LICENSE.txt",
	"compatibility": "Core authoring guidance works in Claude and Copilot. The bundled Python automation still requires Python.",
